    "title": "うちの仔市場 in 郡山DX vol.14",
    "region": "tohoku",
    "prefecture": "福島県",
    "place": "ビッグパレットふくしま",
    "address": "福島県郡山市南2丁目52",
    "image": "images/event/sui-on-uchinoco-ichiba-koriyama-dx-2026.jpg",
